# Calculation-backed scenes, run inside the Builder on the tests/apps
# fixture calc-water-vib (Gaussian-16 water, STO-3G, opt+freq).
style Ball And Stick
viewall
snap calc-water-base
mo 5 0.05 40
snap calc-water-mo5-homo
clear
nmvect 2
snap calc-water-nmode-vectors
nmstep 2 3
snap calc-water-nmode-frame3
gtstep 1
snap calc-water-trace-step1
thumb calc-water-thumb
# Six scene changes, one geometry-trace step each, no forced repaint.
redraws calc-water-redraws 1 0 1 0 1 0
